      "message": "Drop orphaned tofu output + dead local after MSAL deletion\n\nPR #34 deleted tofu/oauth.tf (the azuread_application.microsoft_login\nresource) but left a tofu/outputs.tf entry referencing\nazuread_application.microsoft_login.client_id — which made tofu plan\nfail with \"Reference to undeclared resource\" on main.\n\nAlso drops the now-unused front_app_dns_name local (its only callers\nwere the deleted oauth.tf redirect URIs, the deleted appconfig.tf key\nprefix, and the deleted app_config_prefix output).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e",
